p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Patchset 3 (change 2193): fixed CI regression. Root cause: plan_pass assumed every ctx.mutations item is a typed Mutation, but the reconcile path legitimately mixes typed Mutations with legacy plain-dict mutations (documented dual shape in run_differs). Fix: filter ctx.mutations to typed items (duck-typed on .target) at the run_differs shadow-attach seam before plan_pass; legacy dicts are not part of the typed planning surface. Added held-out regression test test_run_differs_shadow_plan_tolerates_legacy_dict_mutations (teeth-verified: reverting the filter -> AttributeError at ticket_planner.py:112). Full reconciler suite 3362 passed, lint+typecheck clean.","timestamp":1787600340674036001}],"completion_expectation":"required","created_at":1787028015622391001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"fe460065-5c90-4b5a-b32b-1dd4e86734f5","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"c4cb-77f4-ad00-43a6"},{"link_uuid":"7420112d-0bfc-482a-a5aa-a189784890a3","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"d37b-33c3-e5a7-4320"},{"link_uuid":"31bb45de-39ae-4510-b18a-54384d0b6154","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"620c-92e6-983e-478e"}],"description":"## Context\nPlanning currently mixes snapshot reads, binding decisions, mode limits, and later handler assumptions. Retry recovery cannot be stable until all decisions derive from one frozen observation.\n\n## Outcome\nDefine immutable `Observation` and `TicketPlan` values and a pure planner that preserves the existing `Mutation` vocabulary/serialization. This task covers deterministic value construction only, not lifecycle dependency logic or preview output.\n\n## Plan\n1. Add frozen provider-neutral observation/version and per-ticket plan types with open payloads.\n2. Build pure planner inputs from local snapshot, remote snapshot, binding read view, mode, selection/filter, and limits.\n3. Refactor existing differ decisions into plan mutation values without filesystem, provider, subprocess, or clock I/O.\n4. Preserve existing mutation serialization and canonical hashes exactly.\n\n## Testing\nFeed frozen fixtures twice and compare immutable plans, hashes, diagnostics, and version identity. Poison all I/O seams.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [x] Identical frozen inputs produce equal immutable observations and ticket plans.\n- [x] Plans carry existing mutations, diagnostics, disposition, and observation/version identity.\n- [x] Existing mutation serialization and canonical hashes remain byte-identical.\n- [x] Planner construction performs zero repository saves, ticket writes, Jira calls, subprocess launches, or ambient clock reads.\n- [x] Provider-specific payload extensions remain open without weakening the provider-neutral core fields.\n\n## Out of scope\nLifecycle intents, inter-ticket dependencies, caps ordering, preview rendering, and shadow cutover.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/observation.py","reason":"Immutable per-pass operation observation."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/ticket_plan.py","reason":"Immutable provider-neutral per-ticket plan values."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/ticket_planner.py","reason":"Pure planning from one frozen observation."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/run_differs.py","reason":"Feed existing differ outputs into the pure planner."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_ticket_plan_shadow.py","reason":"Determinism, serialization parity, immutability, and zero-I/O tests."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["parent","f828-6f5e-3b15-41f5"],["relates_to","620c-92e6-983e-478e"],["relates_to","c4cb-77f4-ad00-43a6"],["relates_to","d37b-33c3-e5a7-4320"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"f828-6f5e-3b15-41f5","parent_status_uuid":"508470b3-49ac-4a46-89bf-ac884a28d4c0","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":["rp03","planner","tdd"],"ticket_id":"0ad4-9f1c-09f6-4760","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-03 S2 T1 — Build immutable observations and pure ticket plans","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_ticket_plan_shadow.py -k \"observation or deterministic or serialization or zero_io\"","dd_id":"AC1-AC5","dd_text":"Deterministic immutable plans, mutation parity, zero I/O, and open payloads"}]},"source_event_uuids":["4bc13a67-70aa-4559-ba46-9a10f6148211","b4ca4f9e-c4ef-45aa-a2d0-a94a6e124361","71627218-edb7-49c3-89b4-bf4ac8dc057c","e3c2af5a-7faa-409d-9d43-2cdd39705289","fe460065-5c90-4b5a-b32b-1dd4e86734f5","7420112d-0bfc-482a-a5aa-a189784890a3","a97ee484-b4fe-42f7-a615-e0749e1dee1b","31bb45de-39ae-4510-b18a-54384d0b6154","0debedbc-27cb-4e31-9025-39166bfff3ae","508470b3-49ac-4a46-89bf-ac884a28d4c0","7af2424a-77c4-4ca6-b70a-6d80a427589e"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787615041964299001,"uuid":"75142f0c-a0e0-4fac-b1b0-39a185c4dfd9"}